Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 18:34:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/21] Keep 'Then for each ...,' prefix clauses with their
 body (Rottenmouth Viper)

The sequence splitter treats 'then for each ' as a prefix clause so the
repeat count binds to the following effect. CR 608.2c, 608.2h.

Co-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
